---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { OfflineIndicator } from '@/components/OfflineIndicator';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main class="flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 px-4">
    <div class="w-full max-w-md text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">쪽집게</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">손해평가사 자격시험 AI 학습 서비스</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">평가 환경 (MVP) · Phase 2</p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <a
          href="/study/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-500"
          >학습 시작하기</a
        >
        <a
          href="/auth/login"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 transition hover:bg-gray-50"
          >로그인 / 회원가입</a
        >
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-gray-400">
        학습 시작하기 클릭 후 로그인이 필요한 경우 자동으로 로그인 페이지로 이동합니다.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <OfflineIndicator client:load />
</BaseLayout>
